Third-party dependencies:
  - serde_json (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — JSON parsing of hook payloads.

The obfuscation detectors draw on publicly documented research into prompt
injection via hidden characters and auto-rendered exfiltration channels
(Trojan Source; NVIDIA/SkillSpector obfuscation studies; the "Embrace The Red"
corpus on image-based exfiltration). No third-party code is vendored from those
sources; only the threat taxonomy is referenced.
